Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:05.40,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 男单1/4决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:05.40,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}哈恰诺夫 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}3-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 布洛克斯 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:02.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Karen, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:02.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,卡伦 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:04.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I know it's maybe not the way you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道 这可能不是你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:07.04,EN,,0,0,0,,wanted it to end, but let's talk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,想要的结束方式 不过我们聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:08.88,EN,,0,0,0,,about your form coming into here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:08.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你来这儿时的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:10.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Where where did all this confidence come
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一身自信
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:10.48,EN,,0,0,0,,from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,到底是哪来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.80,EN,,0,0,0,,It's been a new Karen Khachanov.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,像是换了一个哈恰诺夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's not new.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实不新
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:15.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I would say it's old in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,某种程度上还是老样子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:18.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, look, Alex,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,是这样 Alex
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I was preparing really really well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我准备得非常非常充分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:22.32,EN,,0,0,0,,for for that matchup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,为了这场对阵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:24.24,EN,,0,0,0,,It's not easy really to play
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场球其实不好打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:26.72,EN,,0,0,0,,because from one side I was feeling I was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:26.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为一方面 我感觉自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:28.40,EN,,0,0,0,,dominating from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,从一开始就占着上风
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:30.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Then I started to feel like he was struggling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:30.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,后来我开始感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:31.52,EN,,0,0,0,,more and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:31.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,他越来越吃力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.52,0:00:33.60,EN,,0,0,0,,And and you know it's a mixed feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.52,0:00:33.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种感觉很复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:35.60,EN,,0,0,0,,because I feel like I'm better let's say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为可以说 我更占便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:38.32,EN,,0,0,0,,in certain situations he's suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:38.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,而某些时候他在难受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:40.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't want to scream come
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:40.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不想去喊加油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:41.20,EN,,0,0,0,,on or something like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:41.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者类似的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:42.64,EN,,0,0,0,,that you know and and I wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:42.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:44.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to keep the energy still there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,把力气留着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:47.28,EN,,0,0,0,,but yeah look I wish him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:47.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,但不管怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:48.24,EN,,0,0,0,,a speedy recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我祝他早日康复
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:48.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Definitely I saw
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:48.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我确实看得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.96,0:00:52.64,EN,,0,0,0,,that really he was suffering all over his body
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.96,0:00:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,他浑身都在难受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:54.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm super happy guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,而我特别开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:54.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm in semi-finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:54.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我进四强了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:55.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:55.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:56.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:56.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:59.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Semi-finals. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:59.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,半决赛 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Second time now in the semi-finals here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是你第二次在这儿打进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:03.36,EN,,0,0,0,,What do you feel like you learned
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:03.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得从第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:04.56,EN,,0,0,0,,from the first time and ready
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:04.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,学到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:07.04,EN,,0,0,0,,to take another step forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.56,0:01:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,准备好再往前一步了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, look we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 走着看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:11.84,EN,,0,0,0,,We'll see. Obviously obviously it's a goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:11.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,走着看 这当然是个目标
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:13.60,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, once you are in the semi-finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:13.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,一旦进了四强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:14.96,EN,,0,0,0,,you are thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:14.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你自然会想着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:16.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to make one more step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,再往前迈一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:17.76,EN,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:20.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I will definitely now watch Sasha
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:20.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我肯定会看兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.80,0:01:21.76,EN,,0,0,0,,against Botic
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.80,0:01:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,对范德赞德舒尔普那场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:24.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and prepare whoever wins
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,谁赢了就准备谁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:26.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and try to do my best as always, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:26.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,一如既往 尽我所能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:28.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I always see you doing your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我每次看你都是全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.24,0:01:29.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I always see you physically ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.24,0:01:29.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体状态一直很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:30.64,EN,,0,0,0,,It seems like the three out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,看起来五盘三胜这个赛制
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:32.88,EN,,0,0,0,,of five format is is great for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:32.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别适合你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:35.20,EN,,0,0,0,,What kind of training do you do to be I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你平时都怎么训练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,don't think I've ever seen you tired out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我好像没见你在这儿累过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:39.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was thinking even maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:39.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 我刚还在想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.36,0:01:41.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to go to serve now a little bit, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.36,0:01:41.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在就去练会儿发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:43.68,EN,,0,0,0,,because the percentage was not so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为成功率不太高
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:45.60,EN,,0,0,0,,At the same time, I have tomorrow day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:45.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,同时 我明天休息一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:48.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, recovery day and practice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:48.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,也就是恢复加训练的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:49.76,EN,,0,0,0,,So, definitely I don't like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:49.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 我不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.76,0:01:51.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to to have a days off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.76,0:01:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,有休息日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:53.04,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, once you're in this rhythm,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,一旦进了这个节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:55.36,EN,,0,0,0,,in this dynamics, in this momentum,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:55.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,进了这种势头里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:57.68,EN,,0,0,0,,you want to keep going unless it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,就想一直打下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:01:59.04,EN,,0,0,0,,was a really, really difficult match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:01:59.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,除非那场球实在太苦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:01:59.92,EN,,0,0,0,,that you say, "Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:01:59.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,苦到你会说 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.92,0:02:01.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I cannot I cannot stand up," you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.92,0:02:01.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我都站不起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.76,0:02:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, congratulations,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.76,0:02:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,那么 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,semi-finalist Karen Khachanov.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.96,0:02:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进四强的哈恰诺夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:06.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you, guys. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:06.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家 谢谢
